# PortSwigger SQL Injection Lab 2: Login Bypass

## Vulnerability
SQL Injection in login form

## Attack
Username: administrator'--
Password: 'anything' (blank)

## How It Works
- ' closes the string
- -- comments out password check
- Website ignores password verification
- Login succeeds without correct password

## Payload Breakdown
administrator'-- 
- Closes username string
- Comments out: AND password = 'xxx'
- Database only checks username
- Result: Bypass authentication

## Result
✅ Logged in as administrator without password

## Prevention
- Use parameterized queries
- Never concatenate user input to SQL
